reuse_key tachyon-serverless-application lib repository::contract_tests::sqlite::only_an_exactly_matching_reuse_key_is_reused
reuse_key tachyon-serverless-application lib services::pool::tests::reuse_needs_both_idle_capabilities_supported_and_the_config_on
reuse_key tachyon-serverless-application lib services::pool::tests::a_claim_racing_a_release_never_takes_a_row_without_its_session
reuse_key tachyon-serverless-application lib config::tests::environment_reuse_is_off_by_default_and_validated_when_enabled
reuse_key tachyon-serverless-application test:pipeline another_revision_never_reuses_the_first_revisions_environment
reuse_key tachyon-serverless-application test:pipeline a_rotated_secret_supersedes_the_reuse_key_and_forces_a_cold_start

# --- lease / epoch fencing: a stale attempt or copy can never settle or overwrite -------------
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-domain lib environment::tests::lease_fencing
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-domain lib environment::tests::reassignment_advances_the_epoch_and_fences_the_previous_attempt
