lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application lib bridge_session::tests::rejects_wrong_environment_and_protocol_version
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application lib repository::contract_tests::memory::an_environment_copy_from_another_epoch_is_refused
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application lib repository::contract_tests::sqlite::an_environment_copy_from_another_epoch_is_refused
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application lib repository::contract_tests::sqlite::attempts_and_leases_are_final_once_settled
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application lib repository::contract_tests::sqlite::releasing_respects_the_pool_caps_and_refuses_a_stale_copy
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application lib repository::sqlite::tests::cas_holds_across_separate_connections_to_the_same_file
lease_epoch tachyon-serverless-application test:pipeline a_late_frame_from_the_previous_attempt_cannot_settle_the_reused_one

# --- deadline enforcement: the host enforces deadlines, clients can only shorten them ---------
